---
import { CONTATO, whatsappLinkFor } from '~/data/vestidos';
import { asset } from '~/utils/asset';
---

<footer class="relative mt-24 border-t border-ink/8 bg-burgundy-deep text-cream/80">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/60 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <img
          src={asset('/logo/rosa-charmosa-dark-360.webp')}
          alt="Rosa Charmosa — vestidos de festa"
          width="360"
          height="202"
          class="h-24 w-auto"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/70">
          Há 13 anos vestindo as Charmosas com o vestido dos sonhos. Agende sua prova e encontre a peça perfeita pro seu grande dia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold/90">Onde estamos</h4>
        <address class="mt-4 not-italic text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/80">
          {CONTATO.endereco.rua}<br />
          {CONTATO.endereco.bairro}<br />
          {CONTATO.endereco.cidade} — {CONTATO.endereco.estado}<br />
          <span class="text-cream/55">CEP {CONTATO.endereco.cep}</span>
        </address>
        <a
          href={CONTATO.mapsUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="group mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gold transition-colors hover:text-rose"
        >
          Abrir rota no Google Maps
          <span class="transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold/90">Horário</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-cream/80">
          <li>{CONTATO.horario.semana}</li>
          <li>{CONTATO.horario.sabado}</li>
          <li class="text-cream/50">{CONTATO.horario.domingo}</li>
        </ul>

        <h4 class="mt-8 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold/90">Contato</h4>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href={whatsappLinkFor()} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cream hover:text-gold transition-colors">
              WhatsApp {CONTATO.telefone}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={CONTATO.instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cream hover:text-gold transition-colors">
              @{CONTATO.instagramHandle}
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-cream/10 pt-6 text-xs text-cream/45 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Rosa Charmosa — Locação Moda Festa</p>
      <p class="italic">Vestindo Charmosas desde 2013</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
